     "title": "The story",
     "md": "Nkeng lives in a village near Bamenda. Every morning she wakes up early and fetches water from the stream. Then she washes her face and eats corn porridge. After that she walks to school with her friends. In class she likes to read. Her favourite book is about a clever tortoise. One day she wants to be a teacher."
